{"step_index":133,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-11T14:43:39Z","thinking":"**Identifying `Finset.max` Behavior**\n\nRealized `Finset.max` returns `WithBot α`, not `WithTop α`, contrary to an earlier assumption. Correctly identified `Finset.min` returns `WithTop α`. This is important because now `exact Finset.mem_of_max h` seems valid.\n\nChecked behavior of `Option.getD` for `WithBot ℕ`, observing `Option.getD (⊥ : WithBot ℕ) 0` equals `0`, and `Option.getD (↑m : WithBot ℕ) 0` evaluates to `m`. Now, proceed to examine specific branches in the original logic.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_to_file","args":{"CodeContent":"\"import Mathlib\\nimport LeanProject.GraphInvariantsComputable\\n\\nopen SimpleGraph\\n\\nlemma largestDegreeSum_one_lt {V : Type} [Fintype V] [DecidableEq V]\\n    (G : SimpleGraph V) [DecidableRel G.Adj] (hV : 2 ≤ Fintype.card V) :\\n    GraphCalc.largestDegreeSum G 1 < Fintype.card V := by\\n  unfold GraphCalc.largestDegreeSum\\n  cases h : ((Finset.univ.powersetCard 1).image (fun s => ∑ v ∈ s, G.degree v)).max with\\n  | bot =>\\n    have : 0 < Fintype.card V := by omega\\n    exact this\\n  | coe m =>\\n    have hm : m ∈ ((Finset.univ.powersetCard 1).image (fun s => ∑ v ∈ s, G.degree v)) :=\\n      Finset.mem_of_max h\\n    rcases Finset.mem_image.mp hm with ⟨s, hs, rfl⟩\\n    rcases Finset.mem_powersetCard.mp hs with ⟨-, hs_card⟩\\n    rcases Finset.card_eq_one.mp hs_card with ⟨v, rfl⟩\\n    simp only [Finset.sum_singleton]\\n    exact G.degree_lt_card_verts v\\n\"","Description":"\"Test largestDegreeSum_one_lt proof\"","Overwrite":"true","TargetFile":"\"/mnt/home/japake298/project/GraphConjecturing/handoff/promising13/task_8ca1b27c/scratch.lean\"","toolAction":"\"Write file\"","toolSummary":"\"Test largestDegreeSum_one_lt in scratch.lean\""}}]}
